{"flow": "candidate-checks", "desc": "审核前把能机械发现的问题先交作者修掉 (09 第 1, 2 步): 单回调耗时, `prepare` 的 warning, 文本与术语检查, 再做一次判断模型预检提示.", "entry": "stage", "returns": {"ready": "可以冻结", "nothing": "没有改动", "stopped": "用户停止"}}
{"id": "stage", "type": "call", "desc": "暂存当前候选.", "call": "stage-candidate", "next": {"staged": "callbacks", "nothing": "return:nothing", "stopped": "return:stopped"}}
{"id": "callbacks", "type": "program", "desc": "新增或改动的测试回调耗时不超过阈值; 仓库可配置为超出也接受.", "primitive": "tests.measureCallbacks", "args": {"thresholdMs": "$param.validation.callbackThresholdMs", "policy": "$param.validation.callbackOverThreshold"}, "next": {"ok": "precheck", "accepted-over": "precheck", "over-threshold": "ask-callbacks"}, "src": ["skills/commit/implementation-workflow.md#2"]}
{"id": "ask-callbacks", "type": "waitUser", "desc": "超阈值的精确案例要用户批准.", "next": {"approve": "precheck", "fix": "fix", "stop": "return:stopped"}, "question": "以下新增或改动的测试回调超过耗时阈值 (实测值见背景). 批准这些精确案例为例外, 交作者修改, 或停止.", "options": ["approve", "fix", "stop"], "context": ["$result.callbacks.cases"], "src": ["skills/commit/implementation-workflow.md#2"]}
{"id": "precheck", "type": "program", "desc": "现行 `prepare` 的 warning 行与必要检查; 有问题不启动 Reviewer.", "primitive": "commitAudit.precheck", "args": {"checkIds": ["text-check", "terms-check", "code-map-verify-if-enabled", "validation-summary-warnings"]}, "next": {"pass": "hints", "warnings": "fix"}, "src": ["skills/commit/implementation-workflow.md#13"]}
{"id": "fix", "type": "agent", "desc": "只在检查失败时才走到这里.", "work": "author", "next": {"fixed": "stage", "ask-user:stop": "return:stopped"}, "write": {"scope": "instance"}, "instruction": "审核前的确定性检查报告了问题 (见输入), 修正后交回; 这些问题不留给 Reviewer. 无法在授权范围内修正时交用户.", "inputs": ["$result.precheck.warnings", "$result.callbacks.cases"], "output": {"branch": ["fixed", "ask-user"], "fields": {"question": "string?"}}, "src": ["skills/commit/implementation-workflow.md#13"]}
{"id": "hints", "type": "call", "desc": "判断模型预检提示, 每轮最多一次.", "call": "review-hints", "next": {"clear": "return:ready", "changed": "stage"}}
